  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As a user over the age of both 18 and 21, I don't feel comfortable with sharing an instance with children in between the ages of 13 and 17, maybe younger. I believe that both Users of this platform as well as the platform itself would make benefits because not only do the users feel safer for knowing that an instance is labeled as 18+, children using the platform also have a safe place to be and the platform would have more of a positive feedback for both the children and users over the ages of 18 and 21. A way that this can be achieved is for a verification of age through the VRChat website by simply asking for the users Date Of Birth and a picture of the users Government ID Card. That option cannot be adjusted and any accounts created with an exact match of an IP address and/or email address, is declined of the creation of the account.",
